# Toggle Wi-Fi once through Control Center (offline cases, REQ-020: only after `xcrun devicectl device info details`
# shows transportType wired and `device.ts status` shows a live session). Starts: any screen. Ends: the same screen
# with Control Center closed; prints the wifi-button-round value (1 = on, 0 = off) — read it back every time.
# Written 2026-10-23 (P9-h). Control Center opens from the top-right corner; it opens on Now Playing, so tap the Connectivity page icon (397,510) in the right-hand page strip.
drag 380 3 380 450 400
wait 2
tap 397 510
wait 1
id wifi-button-round
wait 3
els wifi-button
shot wifi-toggle
tap 210 870
wait 1
